- [`tasks/`](tasks/) — per-task markdown files (one per GitHub issue tracked by `task-register`)
- [`ui/`](ui/) — local-host read-only console (Python + Jinja2; see "Console (read-only browser)" above)
- [`.claude/`](.claude/) — agents (by dept subfolder), global skills, settings

